dialogue = Array[String](["[b]Senior Engineer:[/b] I swear to [shake rate=20.0 level=5 connected=1]f**kin [b]GOD[/b][/shake] this whole place would collapse without me.", "[b]Senior Engineer:[/b] Not a joke! Our servers, the network, all of our microservices, the [b]DATABASE[/b]...", "[b]Senior Engineer:[/b] [shake rate=20.0 level=5 connected=1][b]ALL OF IT![/b][/shake] Poof, without me.", "[b]Senior Engineer:[/b] [shake rate=20.0 level=5 connected=1](╯°□°）╯︵ ┻━┻[/shake]"])

