[node name="SpeakComponent" parent="NPCs/BossNPC" index="3" unique_id=1744893008]
dialogue = Array[String](["[b]Big Boss:[/b] We’re very focused on modernizing our legacy systems, focused on data, we have to reduce friction in day to day AI utilization.", "[b]Big Boss:[/b] With data, comes [tornado radius=10.0 freq=1.0 connected=1]AI![/tornado] So many use cases.", "[b]Big Boss:[/b] We need to leverage what’s been done and innovate our strategies to get ahead of the game.", "[b]Big Boss:[/b] Friends? Family? What are you talking about?? [shake rate=20.0 level=5 connected=1]There's no time![/shake] You have the PTO hours for that??", "[b]Big Boss:[/b] Our customers expect speed and the analogy is you need to go fast but you need controls in the car. Literally, we’re demystifying…", "[b][rainbow freq=1.0 sat=0.8 val=0.8 speed=1.0]Jim Jar:[/rainbow][/b] [i]...what is this one talking about?[/i]"])

